    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[h2]Discover &quot;Wathan Games&quot;[/h2]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Wathan Games&quot; is the ultimate <strong>quiz</strong> to energize your streams and create unforgettable <strong>interactions</strong> between streamers and their viewers. The <strong>chat</strong> becomes an indispensable ally, guiding the streamer through 5 thrilling levels of difficulty. With 5 unique artifacts to spice up each session, every game becomes an epic quest. Join the adventure with &quot;Wathan Games&quot; and transform your <strong>streaming</strong> experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Rich and Varied Content</u></strong>: Explore over <strong>10,000 questions</strong> of varying difficulties across 6 categories, including <strong>video games</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thematic Seeds</strong>: Test your knowledge on specific topics with <strong>thematic</strong> question series.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Graphics</strong>: Dive into a visually rich universe, entirely <strong>hand-drawn</strong> by &quot;My name is Ebo&quot;, ensuring an immersive experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global Leaderboard</strong>: Add a competitive dimension with a <strong>worldwide ranking</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join <strong>&quot;Wathan Games&quot;</strong> and take part in a unique adventure where every session becomes an opportunity to strengthen bonds with the chat, share experiences, and compete with the rest of the world.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[h2]Discover &quot;Wathan Games&quot;[/h2]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Wathan Games&quot; is the ultimate <strong>quiz</strong> to energize your streams and create unforgettable <strong>interactions</strong> between streamers and their viewers. The <strong>chat</strong> becomes an indispensable ally, guiding the streamer through 5 thrilling levels of difficulty. With 5 unique artifacts to spice up each session, every game becomes an epic quest. Join the adventure with &quot;Wathan Games&quot; and transform your <strong>streaming</strong> experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Rich and Varied Content</u></strong>: Explore over <strong>10,000 questions</strong> of varying difficulties across 6 categories, including <strong>video games</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thematic Seeds</strong>: Test your knowledge on specific topics with <strong>thematic</strong> question series.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Graphics</strong>: Dive into a visually rich universe, entirely <strong>hand-drawn</strong> by &quot;My name is Ebo&quot;, ensuring an immersive experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global Leaderboard</strong>: Add a competitive dimension with a <strong>worldwide ranking</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join <strong>&quot;Wathan Games&quot;</strong> and take part in a unique adventure where every session becomes an opportunity to strengthen bonds with the chat, share experiences, and compete with the rest of the world.</p>",
